      "payload": "{\"assessment_note\": \"评估只由独立终点证据决定(来源层直报;模型预测/路径推断不能单独产生 supported_*;停止原因永不映射为终点(F01);存在未解决必要依赖时评估保持 unknown(F02);当前路线已引入的必要条件 unknown/conflict 同样保持 unknown(S4-C01,同源 route_assessment;已知兼容正控不受影响));metabolic_handoff 不等于矿化;supported_terminal_transformation_product 不推断永久去除\", \"bookkeeping\": {\"bookkeeping_status\": \"unknown\", \"co2_aggregated\": false, \"co2_product_occurrences\": [], \"co2_run_total\": null, \"events_with_unknown_coefficients\": [{\"event_id\": \"ppev_defbc0a3498a2ac209b3\", \"hypothesis_id\": \"hyp_e08ed8fff2de4595c361\"}], \"missing_participant_state_refs\": [], \"note\": \"账目闭合只表示声明范围内账面闭合(参与物/系数引用完整),不等于发生矿化,也不等于生物可行;不同备选反应生成的 CO₂ 不相加(逐事件/逐备选列示,运行级聚合不产生);root carbon accounting coverage 只表示核查范围,不表示所有根碳已转化;单项 CO₂ 产物不自动解释为根污染物矿化\", \"participants_known_coefficient\": 2, \"participants_total\": 3, \"root_carbon_accounting_coverage\": \"declared_participants_of_submitted_events\", \"root_carbon_fate_inferred_from_bookkeeping\": false, \"root_carbon_fate_status\": \"source_reported_check_scope_only\"}, \"bookkeeping_status\": \"unknown\", \"chemical_endpoint_assessment\": \"supported_mineralization\", \"conditions_snapshot\": {\"condition_keys_known\": [], \"condition_keys_unknown\": [], \"note\": \"条件事实快照(来路/评估权威在 PathContext;此处只采计数,不重评估、不把未知条件判缺席\"}, \"derived_from\": {\"derived_note\": \"重算输入摘要;stop 报告含会话 refusals 不可无会话复算,以持久 stop 记录行 hash 作跨表一致性核对\", \"endpoint_evidence_digest\": \"ad4d85bed8105570a7cc5cf4b2f89020bcfecaa32ed687368cb7897dba9adbfc\", \"endpoint_policy_version\": \"ppv1-endpoint-policy-2\", \"events_digest\": \"7d8563107b00cf3c3245aea86ddbbe18943af8d03bc9d6d0a7ed876c14282bc3\", \"inherited_dependencies_digest\": \"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945\", \"route_conditions_digest\": \"c5a805989923201c1f71a1b6c69dc1e43d7d99e98e63ea7740718cb2d0b1c64e\", \"search_actions_digest\": \"c2f41378e48b7c633fdc82c1bfe5d2860884405208cf976a7db90c174d616568\", \"search_schema_version\": \"ppv1-searc